{"id": 963510, "slug": "save-room-the-merchant", "name": "Save Room - The Merchant", "name_original": "Save Room - The Merchant", "description": "<h3>Gameplay</h3><strong>To progress through each level, the player must possess specific essential items that are necessary for its completion.</strong><br/><br/><strong>In order to obtain these items, you must meticulously arrange your items and  treasures within your inventory.</strong><br/><br/><strong>After that you'll need to engage in the process of selling your treasures to the merchant.</strong><br/><br/><strong>Now, armed with a substantial amount of pesetas, you possess the means to procure the items you require!</strong><br/><br/><strong>To successfully complete the level, all that remains is to place the purchased items back into your inventory.</strong><br/><h3>Features</h3><ul><li><strong><strong>Use your organizing skills to make all your items fit. </strong></strong><br/></li><li><strong>Use your logical thinking to balance your finances and be able to buy the items needed.</strong><br/></li><li><strong>Understand the format of several items to find the best fitting.</strong><br/></li><li><strong>40 unique handmade levels.</strong><br/></li><li><strong>Relaxing music and sound effects made for the game!    </strong></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2023-07-14", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-12-21T14:17:24", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/4ff/4ff52c194db5c42b857cbe146210c935.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/d6a/d6a0685fc51c41b0e4836db57bc870d3.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 9, "added_by_status": {"yet": 2, "owned": 4, "beaten": 1, "toplay": 1, "dropped": 1}, "playtime": 5, "screenshots_count": 7, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 34, "paren