_raw": "Add to your wishlist!\nYou may also likehttps://store.steampowered.com/app/1955330/Save_Room__Organization_Puzzle/\nAbout the GameGameplayTo progress through each level, the player must possess specific essential items that are necessary for its completion.\nIn order to obtain these items, you must meticulously arrange your items and  treasures within your inventory.\nAfter that you'll need to engage in the process of selling your treasures to the merchant.\nNow, armed with a substantial amount of pesetas, you possess the means to procure the items you require!\nTo successfully complete the level, all that remains is to place the purchased items back into your inventory.\nFeaturesUse your organizing skills to make all your items fit.\nUse your logical thinking to balance your finances and be able to buy the items needed.\nUnderstand the format of several items to find the best fitting.\n40 unique handmade levels.\nRelaxing music and sound effects made for the game!"}